Package: wickrazk
Type: Package
Title: Zero-Knowledge Proofs of Backtest Performance
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("kingchenc", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "support@wickra.org")
Description: R bindings for wickra-zk over its C ABI hub. Prove that a
    backtest was run honestly - the report, its hash and the headline metrics -
    without revealing the price data or the strategy that produced it. The proof
    is a RISC Zero receipt over the same deterministic engine every other
    binding drives, so a verdict reached here is the verdict reached anywhere.
    Proving runs a zkVM and takes seconds to minutes; verification is fast.
License: MIT + file LICENSE | Apache License 2.0
URL: https://github.com/wickra-lib/wickra-zk
BugReports: https://github.com/wickra-lib/wickra-zk/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
NeedsCompilation: yes
SystemRequirements: the wickra-zk C ABI shared library (WKPROOF_LIB) and its
    header (WKPROOF_INC).
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
